{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:18:159","content":{"id":159,"title":"第十课：几何I","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f733dd11-a0bf-414f-9fdd-66987141c751","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"纹理的应用，环境光照。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d1202e70-5470-4da3-9235-6950fbecb8ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"纹理其他的应用，纹理就是一块内存，可以对这块内存进行范围查询，滤波。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_94290678-2a64-414d-bbf3-05065fc92e05.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"e1e370bf-bfdb-4bce-a0d9-7a5a3c24c151","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fc7820ca-74df-4990-adf3-d1d38b8229ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"环境映射，任何方向都有光，把光记录下来 -> 环境光照，用纹理描述整个环境光长什么样，纹理可以用来表示环境光"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0c907ac5-e9d6-492a-bb56-76c2e3031792.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"e8ba108b-cfa3-4b44-a7ca-c32ce6135922","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9c90f5d5-8971-4bac-802b-82d5979190ed.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"6e107935-bf66-48b5-a9ad-8eee83aca0ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5e7d346f-8c2d-43be-873c-c87d2d62f097","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"把不同的环境光记录在球面上，并且展开，问题，扭曲问题，不是均匀的描述"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_94665e60-b110-481c-949b-dfe72ad10b05.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"4c6e4d23-308a-446d-8fed-298710d4408f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_403631cb-14cb-480d-9485-37f8da085c5c.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"5cb66554-c6f9-4cec-8067-77b14d4b8219","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a6986853-acb1-4324-af43-957a145670ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"球有一个立方体包围盒"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_64fe5572-f74f-46f3-b953-a4780fd94550.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"1db4a8fa-6973-46b6-b2f7-faeda9849338","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_942f05de-02b7-44dd-b7ac-947c726328e6.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"079675dc-73f2-4fdc-bde8-e2483cf6d042","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c86a777f-41dd-4755-a696-3341f651f6e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"凹凸贴图，纹理不仅可以替换颜色，可以定义任意不同位置，任意不同的属性，不把几何形体变复杂的情况，利用复杂的纹理定义任何一个点相对的高度，相对的高度发生变化，法线就会发生变化，着色就会发生变化"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e2f7fd29-ec1e-419f-b356-df71cd7aec95.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"637024e4-daa6-480b-b9f8-f61b8346df92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7f6a1eba-8fd7-4535-abf8-9bb4272545dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"法线贴图做了什么事,定义了复杂的纹理,但不改变几何信息,把任何一个像素的法线做一个扰动,通过定义不同位置的高度,邻近的高度差重新计算法线"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_54007ae3-b8d9-4d9d-9b86-b0341d8292f1.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"9a830cfc-1673-4e1a-8c5c-b30646c8874f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1c1891d4-1399-4213-9a42-25f876eff74e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何计算法线如何变化,可以求得切线,如何求得法线呢,把切线逆时针旋转 90°"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2739aadb-8816-4a0b-ab33-3facfea7d9a8.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"e2ba84e3-31a4-4381-b872-dc36cb98c8a4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ef1bff2d-040d-49c1-9803-f4771bde4932.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"69b80002-aa2d-4838-b9fc-34a658c10c99","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"39255dd4-a6c5-403d-967d-6d92a69d270c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"位移贴图，凹凸和位移都是用一个纹理定义一个点的相对高度，输入完全一样，位移贴图实际上会把三角形的顶点、面"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"真的做一个位移"},{"type":"formatted","text":",从而改变法线。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"10916052-254d-4734-943a-8954ad2118c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"位移贴图的效果更好，但是有代价，要求三角形足够密，模型要能跟得上纹理的变化速度"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b702deb4-68df-4fbf-801f-6862c75c93cf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"DirectX，动态切面细分，根据需要细分。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_279926c8-31a2-4091-b8d4-47431eea5603.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"3991e00f-e14d-4a77-9708-3c5eebb69934","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a9c08091-370a-44a6-87f7-f16a6d8b5aff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"三维的纹理，把球砍一半可以看到内部是什么，没有真的纹理的图，使用的噪声"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_7ec0adc5-5947-44e3-99ea-71d9be357a2b.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f377efd4-d74e-4132-b42e-6622c9b74f07","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2264487d-fc4d-4fca-abe8-6ecf8bfe740f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"纹理还可以记录之前算好的信息。怎么计算阴影（左侧和右侧对比，右侧阴影），可以实时算，环境光遮蔽，但是我们可以先计算好，放到纹理中，这样就非常快，把一些计算放在之前做"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b430e76e-e46d-4fe4-9335-41c20a11fee7.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"7dbc093b-1592-4305-b977-07bd356b5687","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"beb74ae1-a657-452f-808a-94c55e4193e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"da6720a3-659b-4c1a-a252-bfd428e9694b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目标：几何的例子，几何的表示方法。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9f163387-f294-4004-abe6-7541eb98a69b.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"3040d894-0004-4c81-9834-29aff5b10b8e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"931ce8da-6d46-46c9-9147-c3325ba2997e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"车子的曲面。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6979448d-ea77-4026-8c6c-77fbf763de43.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"59354eb6-1dad-44f3-9a4d-e0240c694886","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"90b2f522-da52-477e-9028-b8e6f9d162f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"发动机的齿轮"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a78e1afe-ee5b-40e5-86d0-0352edf2dc71.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"211f16e2-0b62-4b8c-91c2-9b79ebbe28c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"75e0a55e-66a7-487b-8e04-af8e8e3e0093","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"衣服布料，不是简单的曲面，因为是透明的，很复杂"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d6f2365d-2855-4acd-9116-ef0c202990b5.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb